<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Dama Korea handles browser storage, external correction reports, analytics and advertising-related data." noindex={true}>
  <article class="legal-shell article-body legal-page"><p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: 21 August 2026</p><h2>Data minimization</h2><p>Dama Korea does not currently operate an email form, account system or newsletter. Interactive checklist selections are stored in your browser’s local storage and are not sent to Dama Korea.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Corrections submitted through the linked GitHub issue tracker are public and processed under GitHub’s terms and privacy practices. Do not submit identity documents, private addresses or sensitive records.</p><h2>Analytics, cookies and advertising</h2><p>The site may use analytics and Google AdSense. These services may process device information, approximate location, browser data and interactions, and may use cookies or similar technologies subject to consent requirements in your region.</p><h2>Consent and choices</h2><p>Where required, an available consent interface can be used to manage optional cookies and advertising choices. Browser controls may also clear local checklist data and stored preferences.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>Limited data may be processed by providers used to host, secure, measure or monetize the site. Dama Korea does not sell reader information.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>General content corrections can be raised through the <a href="/contact/">public corrections page</a>. Do not disclose personal information in the public tracker.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
